            "line": 643,
            "text": "theorem integral_weighted_radial_scale (b : ℝ) {q : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q) (g : ℝ → ℝ) :\n    (∫ r in Ioi (0 : ℝ), r ^ 2 * (q ^ b * g (r / Real.sqrt q))) =\n      q ^ (b + 3 / 2) * ∫ R in Ioi (0 : ℝ), R ^ 2 * g R"
